logos/make-logo.py: --black, --no-label and --tree-scale, used to draw
logos/r36sclone/logo.bmp and logo-firstboot.bmp (defaults unchanged). Not
needed to build: the bmps are committed. To redraw them:
  git apply patches/r36sclone/make-logo.patch
  python3 logos/make-logo.py 640 480 logos/r36sclone/logo.bmp --black --no-label --tree-scale 1
  git apply -R patches/r36sclone/make-logo.patch

diff --git a/logos/make-logo.py b/logos/make-logo.py
index d45596c..5445102 100644
